findings.body:
The "redundant clone" was in `delete_cookie`, which sent `WebviewMessage::DeleteCookie(cookie.clone().into_owned())`. The PR changed the variant as well as the clone. `delete_cookie` now sends `SetCookie`, so it is identical to `set_cookie` above it.

::diff{file="crates/tauri-runtime-wry/src/lib.rs" lines="1710-1721"}

The event loop handler routes `SetCookie` to `webview.set_cookie(&cookie)`. `Webview::delete_cookie` will therefore re-set the cookie it was asked to remove. Nothing will fail and the deletion simply won't happen.

